    "turn_text": "know, it's interesting the way you ask the question though, but I think, I've never thought about the way you're asking it. Because what I've said is, what's the right approach? I'm a deal guy. I know how I bought and built companies, right? So I figured out, if I'm going to do a transaction with you, I've got to figure out, why would you want to deal with me? And so I'm not suggesting that he's doing it the right way. But Iran is different than North Korea. North Korea is different than China. China is different than Cuba. They're all different than Russia. So I don't know that you can't have just a say, I'm going to do it just this way. But you",
